@startuml examination_request_lifecycle
!theme cyborg
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
!pragma layout smetana
title Which examination context does an Observation carry?
hide empty description
state "OPEN: external request adapter\nprotocol, acknowledgement, durability,\ncancellation/expiry" as Adapter
state "Pending slot (one request)" as Slot {
 state "No pending request" as Empty
 state "Pending request\nvalidated for this device and server binding\nrequest identity, optional patient reference" as Pending
}
state "Session context" as Session {
 state "No session" as NoSession
 state "Examination session\nrequest identity and patient reference copied\nimmutable until the session ends" as Active
 state "Standalone session\nno request: no subject" as Standalone
}
state "Observation\nsubject = supplied patient reference,\nomitted when none was supplied" as Observation
Adapter -[dashed]-> Pending : valid offer
Adapter -[dashed]-> Empty : wrong target, malformed\nor oversized: rejected
[*] --> Empty
Empty --> Pending : valid offer
Pending --> Pending : newest wins: a newer offer replaces and drops it;\nduplicate of the same request: no new examination;\nrejected Start consumes nothing
Pending --> Empty : accepted local Start consumes it (removed at once)
[*] --> NoSession
NoSession --> Active : accepted local Start\nwith a pending request
NoSession --> Standalone : accepted local Start\nwithout a pending request
Active --> Observation : result of this session
Standalone --> Observation : result
Active --> NoSession : session ends (also cancellation, poor signal,\ndelivery failure, acknowledgement):\ncontext is not restored or reused
Standalone --> NoSession : session ends
note right of Active
 New external context cannot replace it or start a measurement;
 an attempted change follows SESSION_CONTEXT_CHANGE handling.
 A request arriving now becomes the pending offer for the next
 examination; a later request never attaches to a running one.
 No adapter network work while listening; an acknowledgement
 may be queued for the next permitted network lease.
end note
@enduml
